Z||000003||Cooter||09-16-2001||01:24 PM||||Another warning about Advance's calipers- When I bought them for my 85, I had to swap the right rear 4 times before I got one that did not leak. They swapped them without question, but it sucked having to keep messing with it.||||reg||1
